## Context
Child of 1830. Closes 1830 with the integration review.

Input from 1841: `data/rel_pool/rel_work_venues.csv` (`make rel-venues`),
joined with `_rel_venues.load_work_venues` (columns `tier`, `flags`,
`excluded`, `excluded_by`, `tier_ngo_in_b`, `tier_ngo_not_b`,
`publisher_flag`). Two author decisions were left pending by 1841 and must be
taken here or shown as sensitivity rows: (a) which registries exclude
(`exclusion` in `config/rel_venue_registries.yaml`; default Kanalregisteret X
and hijacked only, which excludes Scientific Reports, Forests and Energy
Strategy Reviews among others), (b) whether Oxfam and Germanwatch are tier B
(`ngo_research_in_b`, default true; moves no work in the 2026-10-01 pool).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] REL view: exclusions by reason (ICF, discipline, seriousness), one count per reason, reproducible
- [ ] Sensitivity table by publisher flag and by rank
- [ ] PRISMA (`conception/rel-prisma-flux-provisoire.md`) and protocol (`conception/rel-audit-finalisation-corpus.md`) describe the two dimensions, their operational definitions and reasons
- [ ] AGENTS.md gates pass
